; Futuristic: heavy, barred, with a break cut into the stems.
;
; Original pixel art. Two earlier attempts at this face missed what the genre
; is made of. A one-pixel line font read as thin and technical; adding weight
; and chamfered corners got it as far as bold and blocky, which is a different
; thing from futuristic.
;
; The trait doing the work is a one-row break cut into a stem, directly under a
; horizontal bar. A drops its left stem for a row below the top bar; H breaks
; below the crossbar; O notches at the top left and again at the bottom right.
; It reads as a circuit trace stopping and restarting, and it is the rare
; display-face gesture that survives a 1-bit grid intact, because a missing row
; is a missing row at any resolution. The other two cues are cheap and worth
; taking: full-width bars top and bottom, and a high crossbar rather than a
; centred one.
;
; Caps sit on rows 1-8, small caps on 3-8. Lowercase is small caps, as the
; genre generally is.

id: future
name: Futuristic
notice: Original pixel art for Badge Studio.

